(i) The amount of maintenance allowance as fixed by the learned Additional District Judge dated 15-6-2005 at the rate of Rs.1,000 per month is reduced to Rs.800 per month payable by the petitioner to respondent No.1 from the date of institution of the suit, till date;

(ii) The marriage between the parties shall stand dissolved from today in lieu of surrender by Mst. Anjum Firdous respondent No.1 her right of maintenance at the rate of Rs.400 per month from the date of institution of the suit in lieu of consideration for Khula; and

(iii) Mst. Anjum Firdous respondent No.1 however, shall be entitled to recover the maintenance allowance from the petitioner at the rate of Rs.400 per month till 30-6-2006 viz. including the period of Iddat from today.
